    {
        "content": "<p>You could do it in two stages:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Define the new induction principle as <code>private induction_on_nozero</code>, prove the current induction_on in terms of it, do the proposed reordring (the math piece). Make the PR, get it merged</li>\n<li>Delete <code>induction_on</code>, rename and make public <code>private induction_on_nozero</code>, and then ask an LLM to delete all the <code>zero</code> branches that are no longer needed</li>\n</ol>",
